WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.600
Plug in your MIDI keyboard, then open Options, MIDI settings.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.600
Your keyboard is listed and switched on. Here a demo keyboard stands in for yours.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.600
It plays the selected channel, or always the one you pick.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.600
Select an instrument and play: you hear it at once.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.400
To record, press Record, choose Notes, then Play, and play your part.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:37.000
Stop: the notes are in the Piano roll, ready to edit.

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:42.400
Every MIDI keyboard works: no driver or setup needed.
